---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "活動記録"
description: "研究室の活動記録一覧"
---
<div class="page-heading container">
  <h1>活動記録</h1>
  <p>研究室の日々の活動やイベントを紹介します。</p>
</div>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="post-list">
      {% for post in collections.posts %}
      <article class="post-card">
        <img class="post-card__thumbnail" src="{{ post.data.thumbnail }}" alt="">
        <div class="post-card__body">
          <p class="post-card__date">{{ post.data.date | dateJa }}</p>
          <h2 class="post-card__title"><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h2>
          <p class="post-card__excerpt">{{ post.data.excerpt }}</p>
        </div>
      </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
